    primaryClauses: ['Clause 29.1: All Bharat Bus operational fleet vehicles are equipped with AIS-140 certified GPS locators and illuminated panic switches on every window pillar, reporting in real-time to the State Emergency Response Support System (ERSS 112).', 'Clause 29.2: Single female passengers booking protected seats are guaranteed exclusive lady-adjacent seating. No male passenger may be reassigned to adjacent seats without prior express consent.', 'Clause 29.3: CCTV surveillance cameras continuously monitor the interior passenger aisle and door ingress points. Recordings are encrypted and archived for 30 days under Ministry of Home Affairs digital evidence standards.', 'Clause 29.4: Consuming alcohol, smoking tobacco, vaping, or engaging in disorderly conduct is strictly prohibited under Section 112 of the Motor Vehicles Act, warranting immediate deboarding and police handover.', 'Clause 29.5: Driver captains undergo mandatory digital breathalyzer testing at terminal dispatch points prior to starting every commercial service trip.'],
