    primaryClauses: ['Clause 17.1: Bharat Bus strives to maintain 98%+ on-time departure and arrival performance across all national highway transit corridors.', 'Clause 17.2: In the event of mechanical breakdown or tire failure on expressways, our 24x7 Highway Quick Response Team (QRT) must dispatch a replacement bus or mechanical support within 90 minutes of incident logging.', 'Clause 17.3: If a mechanical delay exceeds 3 continuous hours, passengers shall be provided complimentary refreshments and a 30% credit voucher toward their next intercity journey.', 'Clause 17.4: In case of road blockades, severe weather alerts, landslips, or force majeure events, the pilot captain is authorized to take approved detour routes to ensure passenger safety.', 'Clause 17.5: Passengers missing departures due to personal delays at the designated boarding point forfeit the journey without entitlement to same-day refund.'],
